    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39946" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικῡμ-αίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flow in waves over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ θαλάττῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					2.17
				</span></i>
			: metaph., of hair, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤμοις καὶ νώτοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					3.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἱππεῦσιν ἐ. ἡ φάλαγξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ ἐν βυθῷ ἄνθρωπος
			ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.45
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. trans.,
				<i>cause to rise in waves</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν θάλασσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					4.3.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
